  "summary": {
    "value": "Haas-ja-v1.0 is a Japanese speech recognition model built to be both fast and accurate. It is based on NVIDIA's Parakeet-TDT architecture: a FastConformer encoder and a Token-and-Duration Transducer (TDT) decoder, here with a prediction network that uses Kimi Delta Attention (KDA).",
